      "writtenOn": "2022-11-21T19:44:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is this added for? This is very carefully not true. The targets in this file only require that the `skunicode` dependency exist. Currently if `!skia_use_icu \u0026\u0026 !skia_use_client_icu` then there is no `skunicode` implementation, but that simply means that the `skunicode` target should not exist and so the dependency won\u0027t be there, so the build will fail to be created if depending on `skshaper` with `skia_use_harfbuzz`. In other words, this logic belongs somewhere else, not here. The `skshaper` build explicitly should not know anything about ICU or how it is built or any internals of `skunicode`.",
      "revId": "c963247ceacff4106fc1e30283204f10e445cda9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
