      "message": "Done.\nAnd yes, it\u0027s very awkward not to have skunicode implementation for !skia_use_icu \u0026\u0026 !skia_use_client_icu, so eventually I will add a primitive implementation.",
      "parentUuid": "85da8aaa_894139d5",
